{"1802670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mourn-born", "steam_appid": 1802670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanoid abominations are taking over a colony on a faraway planet. Are they mutants? Are they genetically modified experiments? Are they victims of a disease? Whatever their mysterious origins are, they are hostile.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/35b9c27debb56d381948b7b4b0aa3a79.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/35b9c27debb56d381948b7b4b0aa3a79.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/35b9c27debb56d381948b7b4b0aa3a79.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>•Horde combat:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy varying abominations in strategic order. You are fast and agile, but the strength required to swing your heavy sword leaves you immobile when attacking. Time your attacks carefully to prevent being overwhelmed and cornered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/2f1cf3304f23352195d9a4b397d21e36.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/2f1cf3304f23352195d9a4b397d21e36.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/2f1cf3304f23352195d9a4b397d21e36.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Body customization:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace body parts with cybernetic implants and enhanced, lab-grown organs to gain special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/05a411c7fd7f4010ff4221f8667b5d5b.avif?t=1766088141\" width=1084 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Weapon customization:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform four different attacks, which are determined by the way you build your sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/6f7733359c20986f4ef374a5242f0aa4.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/6f7733359c20986f4ef374a5242f0aa4.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/6f7733359c20986f4ef374a5242f0aa4.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Dynamic enemies:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The commonly-encountered base breeds of abominations have set behaviors you can study, but as the game progresses, they gain the ability to merge, birthing horrifying monsters with inherited and enhanced strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/8013d278a52b809a145e07d718dba834.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/8013d278a52b809a145e07d718dba834.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/8013d278a52b809a145e07d718dba834.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Campaign:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a short linear storyline in the start of the game, which serves as an introduction to the world and character objectives. It consists of speaking with characters (no dialogue options; you press a button to get the next line), the player character commenting and speaking outside of conversations (text above the head), memories, item descriptions, and unlockable lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final boss marks the end of the game, with an optional new game plus afterwards. The new game plus makes combat more challenging, but doesn't make changes to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/f4062192ad33d4218d92cf1fc78eaff6.avif?t=1766088141\" width=1084 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Setting:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a strange sword, an unannounced colony guest just joined one of the security teams. Together, they are rescueing survivors. Let's hope the evacuation vessels arrive soon... because something else is also coming. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanoid abominations are taking over a colony on a faraway planet. Are they mutants? Are they genetically modified experiments? Are they victims of a disease? Whatever their mysterious origins are, they are hostile.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/35b9c27debb56d381948b7b4b0aa3a79.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/35b9c27debb56d381948b7b4b0aa3a79.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/35b9c27debb56d381948b7b4b0aa3a79.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>•Horde combat:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy varying abominations in strategic order. You are fast and agile, but the strength required to swing your heavy sword leaves you immobile when attacking. Time your attacks carefully to prevent being overwhelmed and cornered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/2f1cf3304f23352195d9a4b397d21e36.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/2f1cf3304f23352195d9a4b397d21e36.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/2f1cf3304f23352195d9a4b397d21e36.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Body customization:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace body parts with cybernetic implants and enhanced, lab-grown organs to gain special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/05a411c7fd7f4010ff4221f8667b5d5b.avif?t=1766088141\" width=1084 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Weapon customization:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform four different attacks, which are determined by the way you build your sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/6f7733359c20986f4ef374a5242f0aa4.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/6f7733359c20986f4ef374a5242f0aa4.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/6f7733359c20986f4ef374a5242f0aa4.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Dynamic enemies:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The commonly-encountered base breeds of abominations have set behaviors you can study, but as the game progresses, they gain the ability to merge, birthing horrifying monsters with inherited and enhanced strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/8013d278a52b809a145e07d718dba834.poster.avif?t=1766088141\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/8013d278a52b809a145e07d718dba834.webm?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/8013d278a52b809a145e07d718dba834.mp4?t=1766088141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Campaign:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a short linear storyline in the start of the game, which serves as an introduction to the world and character objectives. It consists of speaking with characters (no dialogue options; you press a button to get the next line), the player character commenting and speaking outside of conversations (text above the head), memories, item descriptions, and unlockable lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A final boss marks the end of the game, with an optional new game plus afterwards. The new game plus makes combat more challenging, but doesn't make changes to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/extras/f4062192ad33d4218d92cf1fc78eaff6.avif?t=1766088141\" width=1084 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Setting:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a strange sword, an unannounced colony guest just joined one of the security teams. Together, they are rescueing survivors. Let's hope the evacuation vessels arrive soon... because something else is also coming. </p>", "short_description": "Use a customizable, futuristic sword to violently chop, crush, and slice through hordes of abominations, and replace body parts with cybernetic implants and enhanced, lab-grown organs.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/66b11e9ab26ab247392240edf8cd3e6cd601ea78/header.jpg?t=1766088141", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/faf525260190b220793141ab0de3005c59b18192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766088141", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802670/faf525260190b220793141ab0de3005c59b18192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766088141", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 5 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proce